  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Bagalatia 3",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo na kūzunya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we Bagalatia bachilū chilū, ī gete nani ūyo wamulogile shi? Tūhaya ahene ū Yesu Kilisito akoolechiwa hape hape ū kū būtongi wing'we, gīkī wamala kūkong'wa ha nsalaba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natogilwe muniwīle gūyū mhayo gūmò, ū Moyo mukang'wanukūla kūlwa shītwa sha mu shilagīlo, nūūlū kūlwa kūjiigwa ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza na kūjizunya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nibūlī hangī ng'wachilūhalile gīko? Mukandya chiza mulī Moyo, ī haha mutogilwe kūmalīgīja mu nguzu ja mīlī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gashi ū mu būluhi ū bose ūbo ng'waluhaga, ng'waluhīlaga dalali dūhū? Ūlū ng'hana mubize ng'waluhīlaga dalali! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, ū Mulungu ūyo akūng'winhaga Moyo, na akūbeejaga milīmo ya būdūla būtaale mu bing'we, akwītaga gīko īkī mudimile shilagīlo, nūūlū kūlwa kūgwigwa ū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu na kūgūzunya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo yenīyī ījile gīt'ūmo Abulahamu akabalīlwa būtūngīlīja, kūlwa kūnsanya Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, managi gīkī a banhū abo balī mu kūzunya, hū bene a baana ba ng'wa Abulahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū shandīkwa shalī shimanile kwīngīīla kale na kale, gīkī ū Mulungu akūbabalīla būtūngīlīja kūlwa kūzunya a banhū ba mahanga, h'ī chene shikanomeela Ng'hūlū Jawiza ū Abulahamu gīkī, “Pye a mahanga gakwīlūkīlwa lubango kūfuma mulī bebe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya a banhū abo balī mu kūzunya, basangīlile ī lubango nang'hwe ū Abulahamu, ūyo walī na kūzunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo abo basendamīlile shītwa sha mu shilagīlo, a bene pye balī ng'wizumo; nguno gwandīkilwe gīkī, “Azumilwe būlī ng'wene ūyo atūdūla kūshikīlīja kwīyīta pyī īyo yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha shilagīlo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īlī hape gīkī atīho munhū ūyo ashikile kūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja ū kūlī Mulungu kūlwa shilagīlo; nguno, “Ū ntūngīlīja akūbiza mpanga kūlwa kūzunya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī shilagīlo ī shene shitafumile mu kūzunya, nguno gūhayiwe gīkī, “Ū wa kwīyīta ī yenīyī akūbiza mpanga muyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Kilisito akabiza izumo kūlwa nguno yise, hūna lūūlū wamala kūtūkomoola a bise, ūtwīnja ū ng'wizumo lya shilagīlo, nguno gwandīkilwe gīkī, “Azumilwe būlī ng'wene ū wa kūnungelejiwa ha līntī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ījile gīko kūlwa gīkī, ū mulī Yesu Kilisito na a banhū ba mahanga bajanukūle ī lubango ja ng'wa Abulahamu, tūkwanukūle mu kūzunya ū kwisagījiwa kwa ng'wa Moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo na kwisagījiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badūgū bane, leki namuwīle shigemeng'hejo sha banhū; ūlū munhū ūtūūla ilagane atīho ūngī wa kūlīkenaagūla, nūūlū kūlyongeleleja mhayo gūngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū wisagījiwa ūbo akinhwa ū Abulahamu walī kūlwa nguno yakwe na Myalwa wakwe. Atawīlilwe na “Babyalwa” gītī bingī. Alīyo kūlwa ng'wa ūmò dūhū: “Na kūlī Myalwa wako,” hū Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo nalīgūhaya gūlī gīkī, ī lilagane līkatonga ū kūtūūlwa nū Mulungu, hūna lūūlū ī shilagīlo īsho shikandya kūtūmama ha numa ya myaka magana ane na makūmi adatū, shitīko kūgūkenaagūla nūūlū kūgwīnja ho ū kwisagījiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū wingīji ūlū būlīho kūlwa shilagīlo, būtūdūla kūbiza ho mu nzīla ya kwisagījiwa; alīyo ū Mulungu īkī alī na shigongo, akang'winha wingīji ū Abulahamu mu kūng'wisagīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī lūūlū ī shilagīlo shilī na nīmo kī? Ī shoi shikatūūlwa kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi, kūshisha ize ū Myalwa ūyo walī wamala kwisagījiwa. Shikalagīlwa mu nzīla ya bamalaika, shūshikīlījiwa mu nkono gwa nsangīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, atūdūla kūbiza ho nsangīja kūlw'ipandī līmò dūhū, nguno ū Mulungu alī ūmò.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Basese na baana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī numho lūūlū hū kūhaya ī shilagīlo shiipūganije nū kwisagīja kwa ng'wa Mulungu? Ūtūjaga gīko na hado yaya! Nguno ūlū ni shitūūlilwe ho shilagīlo īsho shidūgije kūtwinha būpanga, ū mhayo gwa kūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja mu nzīla ya shilagīlo ni gūlīho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī shandīkwa shihayile gīkī, pye a banhū balī ha sīlīlī ya shibi. Ū mu gīko ū kwisagījiwa ūko kūlīho kūlwa kūnzunya Yesu Kilisito, bakwinhagwa bazunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho gūtaalī kwiza ū mhayo gwa kūzunya, twalī ha sīlīlī ya shilagīlo, h'īsho shatūlelaga. Twalī tūlugalījiwe hanze yago ū mhayo gwa kūzunya, ūyo yalī gīkī gūloolechiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī shilagīlo shalī na nīmo gwa kūtūlanga, kūshisha līshike ī likanza lya ng'wa Kilisito, ī lya kūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja kūlwa kūzunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, īkī twashikile ū ng'wikanza lya kūzunya, tūtikala ha sīlīlī ya nangi hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pye a bose mulī baana ba ng'wa Mulungu kūlwa kūnzunya Kilisito Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī pye abo mubatīījiwe mulī Kilisito, munzwalile ū Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būtīho būsolanhyiwa a ha gatī ya Nyudaya nū w'ihanga līngī, na a ha gatī ya nsese nū yūyo alī mu wiyabī, nūūlū a ha gatī ya ngosha na nkīma; nguno ū mulī Kilisito Yesu pye a bose mulī būmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
